%% End-to-end flow of one experiment session across the two channels.
%% Solid arrows: REST commands (browser->backend) and in-process port calls.
%% Dashed arrows: WebSocket realtime frames to/from the browser.
%% Render to PDF like the Ch.5 figures:  mmdc -i experiment-flow.mmd -o experiment-flow.pdf
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor R as Researcher
    participant C as Console<br/>(researcher screen)
    participant API as REST API<br/>(FastEndpoints)
    participant M as ExperimentSessionManager
    participant T as Tobii adapter
    participant B as Broadcaster
    participant P as Reader<br/>(participant screen)

    Note over R,P: Configuring (REST commands)
    R->>C: prepare participant, material, device, calibration
    C->>API: POST setup commands
    API->>M: SetCurrent...Async / SetCalibrationState
    M->>B: broadcast snapshot
    B-->>C: experimentState
    B-->>P: experimentState

    Note over R,P: Start
    R->>C: Start session
    C->>API: POST /eyetrackers/start
    API->>M: StartSessionAsync (re-check four gates)
    M->>B: broadcast experimentStarted
    B-->>C: experimentStarted
    B-->>P: experimentStarted

    Note over R,P: Running (realtime over WebSocket)
    P-->>M: subscribeGazeData
    loop per gaze sample
        T->>M: GazeDataReceived
        M->>B: gazeSample + snapshot
        B-->>P: gaze + adapted text
        B-->>C: live mirror + latency
    end
    opt researcher intervention
        R->>C: apply intervention / typography
        C->>M: command (REST or WebSocket)
        M->>B: interventionEvent + snapshot
        B-->>P: text adapts in place
        B-->>C: mirror updates
    end

    Note over R,P: Finishing
    R->>C: Finish session
    C->>API: POST /experiment-session/finish
    API->>M: FinishSessionAsync (seal + export)
    M->>B: broadcast experimentStopped
    B-->>C: experimentStopped
    B-->>P: experimentStopped
